parts.text:
Replace forelock and mane block (lines 717-752) with improved strands.

New forelock:
```
const forelockStrands = [
 {x:-0.04,y:-1.17,z:1.58, tip:[-0.06,-1.30,1.45], r:0.014},
 ...
];
for i in 0..4: base x = (i-2)*0.018; points [[x,-1.17,1.59],[x*1.2,-1.23,1.54],[x*1.5,-1.30,1.44+i*0.005]]; radii [0.016,0.011,0.002]; attach ear bone.
```
Use `createTubeMesh` with circular radii.

Mane:
```
const crestStations = [
 {y:-0.52,z:1.35,bone:'Neck1'},
 {y:-0.62,z:1.43,bone:'Neck1'},
 {y:-0.72,z:1.50,bone:'Neck2'},
 {y:-0.82,z:1.57,bone:'Neck2'},
 {y:-0.92,z:1.625,bone:'Neck3'},
 {y:-1.02,z:1.675,bone:'Neck3'},
 {y:-1.10,z:1.69,bone:'Neck3'},
 {y:-1.16,z:1.67,bone:'Head'},
];
const crestPoints = crestStations.map(s=>[0,s.y,s.z]);
const lowerCrest=...;
place(createTubeMesh(lowerCrest, lowerCrest.map(()=>0.04), lowerCrest.map(()=>0.075),...), 'Neck1');
...
crestStations.forEach((station,index)=>{
 for (const side of [-1,1]) {
   const baseX = side*0.018;
   const points = [
     [baseX, station.y, station.z],
     [baseX + side*0.006, station.y + 0.035, station.z + 0.085],
     [baseX + side*0.014, station.y + 0.065, station.z + 0.16],
     [baseX + side*0.02, station.y + 0.075, station.z + 0.20],
   ];
   const radii = [0.018,0.014,0.008,0.002];
   place(createTubeMesh(points,radii,radii,mane,`ManeStrand_${index+1}_${side>0?'L':'R'}`,6), station.bone);
 }
});
```
At the last station (Head), strands attached to Head will move with head; okay.
- The mane crest tube radii 0.04/0.075; fine.
- Add a few longer strands at the withers (index0/1) with length 0.24; the above is 0.20. Fine.
- The strands are offset ±0.018 and curve outward; they create a full mane.

Let's edit.

